            Version        : G-2012.06
            Date           : Wed Jun 6 12:46:37 2012
            **************************************************

            Dont verify points:

                (Port)  impl:/mp_gt/IBM_CMOS_GApwr.db/CORE/mydesign
                (Port)  ref:/mp_gt/IBM_CMOS_GApwr.db/CORE/mydesign
                (Reg)   impl:/mp_gt/IBM_CMOS_GApwr.db/CORE/STATE_2

            fm_shell (setup)>

