NAME
       report_constants
              Reports user-defined constants.

SYNTAX
       report_constants
              [objectID_list]

   Data Types
              objectID_list string

ARGUMENTS
       objectID_list
              Specifies the design objects (net or port) to report.

DESCRIPTION
       This  command  reports constants that are defined by using the set_con-
       stant command.  By default, the tool returns a list of all  user-speci-
       fied constants.

       The report_constants command generates one line of output for each con-
       stant.  The line includes the value, the  object  ID,  and  the  object
       type, either net or port.

       The report_constants command returns one of the following:
            o 0 to indicate failure
