            Date           : Wed Jun 6 12:46:37 2012
            **************************************************
            Constant   Object
            Value      Type     Object Name
            --------   ------   -----------
            0          port     impl:/WORK/UPC/UPC_DATA_11
            1          port     ref:/WORK/UPC/UPC_DATA_11
            1
            fm_shell>

